    "K_t": "Evidence:\n[1] The Hunting Party Tour was the eleventh concert tour by American alternative metal band Linkin Park.\n[2] The album was written by the band and was produced by Linkin Park vocalist Mike Shinoda and Rick Rubin, who worked together to produce the band's previous studio album \"Minutes to Midnight\" (2007).\n[3] It is the ninth track from their second studio album \"Meteora\" and was released as the fifth and final single from the album.\n[4] It was announced as the band's third US, fourth international and overall final single from their fourth studio album, \"A Thousand Suns\", which was released on September 14, 2010."
